---
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>This Portfolio Site · Marcus</title>
    <meta name="description" content="How this portfolio site is built: a single-file-per-page Astro site with inline CSS, deployed on Vercel." />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div id="wrapper">

      <nav>
        <span class="nav-name">Marcus David Yang | Aerospace Engineer @ UIUC</span>
        <div class="nav-links">
          <a href="/">home</a>
        </div>
      </nav>

      <a href="/#projects" class="back-link">← projects</a>

      <section class="hero">
        <p class="hero-label">Software</p>
        <h1>This Portfolio Site</h1>
        <p class="hero-desc">
          A small Astro site built to hold the rest of these projects —
          kept minimal, fast, and easy to update as new work gets added.
        </p>
        <div class="skill-tags">
          <span class="skill-tag">Astro</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">CSS</span>
          <span class="skill-tag">Vercel</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <p class="section-label">Problem / Goal</p>
      <div class="content-block">
        <p>
          I needed somewhere to put engineering project write-ups that
          wouldn't get in the way of actually writing them — no CMS to
          fight, no build pipeline to debug, just a page per project I could
          add to as work progressed.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="section-label">Approach &amp; Key Decisions</p>
      <div class="content-block">
        <p>
          Built with Astro, using one file per page (a homepage plus one
          file per project under <code>/projects</code>) with the CSS
          written inline in each file's <code>&lt;style&gt;</code> block
          rather than pulled into a shared stylesheet or component library.
          That trades some duplication for the ability to open any single
          page and see everything that affects it in one place — no hunting
          across shared components to change how one project looks.
          Deployed on Vercel, connected directly to GitHub, so pushing to
          the repo is the entire deploy process.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="section-label">Results / Data</p>
      <div class="content-block">
        <p>
          The site is live, fast (static output, no client-side framework
          overhead), and every project on it — including this one — follows
          the same structure: a hero, then Problem/Approach/Results/Lessons
          sections, so new projects are quick to add without redesigning
          anything.
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="section-label">Lessons Learned / What's Next</p>
      <div class="content-block">
        <p>
          Per-file inline CSS is easy to reason about at this scale (a
          handful of pages) but will need revisiting — shared tokens or a
          small component layer — if the project count grows enough that
          keeping the styling consistent by hand becomes a chore.
        </p>
      </div>

      <footer>
        <p>Marcus David Yang</p>
        <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github ↗</a>
      </footer>

    </div>

    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

      body {
        font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
        background: #fafaf9;
        color: #1a1a18;
      }

      #wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 860px;
        margin-left: auto;
        margin-right: auto;
        padding-left: 80px;
        padding-right: 80px;
      }

      nav {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding-top: 2.5rem;
        padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e0dfd8;
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      }

      .nav-name {
        font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 500;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        gap: 2rem;
      }

      .nav-links a {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #888780;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .nav-links a:hover { color: #1a1a18; }

      .back-link {
        display: inline-block;
        font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #888780;
        text-decoration: none;
        letter-spacing: 0.04em;
        margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      }

      .back-link:hover { color: #1a1a18; }

      .hero {
        margin-bottom: 5rem;
      }

      .hero-label {
        font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #b4b2a9;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
        font-size: 44px;
        font-weight: 400;
        line-height: 1.15;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }

      .hero-desc {
        font-size: 16px;
        color: #5f5e5a;
        line-height: 1.7;
        max-width: 480px;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }

      .skill-tags {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 6px;
      }

      .skill-tag {
        font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 10px;
        color: #888780;
        border: 1px solid #d3d1c7;
        border-radius: 100px;
        padding: 3px 9px;
      }

      .section-label {
        font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 11px;
        color: #b4b2a9;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      }

      .content-block {
        margin-bottom: 4rem;
      }

      .content-block p {
        font-size: 15px;
        color: #5f5e5a;
        line-height: 1.75;
        max-width: 560px;
      }

      .content-block code {
        font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
        font-size: 13px;
        background: #f1efea;
        padding: 1px 5px;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }

      footer {
        padding-top: 2rem;
        padding-bottom: 3rem;
        border-top: 1px solid #e0dfd8;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
      }

      footer p {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #b4b2a9;
        font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      }

      footer a {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #b4b2a9;
        font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      footer a:hover { color: #1a1a18; }

      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        #wrapper {
          padding-left: 24px;
          padding-right: 24px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
